        {
          "es": "Un día, mientras barría, cayó del cielo una bola de plumas.",
          "en": "One day, as she swept, a ball of feathers fell from the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Coatlicue la tomó y la guardó en su cintura.",
          "en": "Coatlicue picked it up and tucked it into her waistband."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando terminó de barrer, la buscó, y ya no estaba. Pero ahora Coatlicue esperaba un bebé.",
          "en": "When she finished sweeping, she looked for it, and it was gone. But now Coatlicue was expecting a baby."
        }
